- anolis: arm64: Makefile: Resolve the issue preventing non-privileged users from building kernel modules (Bitao Hu)
- anolis: kconfigs: set CONFIG_LRU_GEN_ENABLED=y (Qinyun Tan)
- anolis: KVM: arm64: Flush TLB during module loading (Hou Wenlong)
