- anolis: intel_th: replaces spin_lock with mutex_lock (wangkaiyuan)
- mm/migrate: fix shmem xarray update during migration (Zi Yan)
- mm: fix finish_fault() handling for large folios (Brian Geffon)
- mm: shmem: fix potential data corruption during shmem swapin (Baolin Wang)
- tcp_bpf: Fix copied value in tcp_bpf_sendmsg (Levi Zim)
- skmsg: Return copied bytes in sk_msg_memcopy_from_iter (Levi Zim)
- anolis: configs: disable CONFIG_VIRT_FUSE (Jingbo Xu)
- anolis: crypto: move digest from sha-224 to sha-256 (Yinan Liu)
- anolis: spec: bug fix for kernel.spec (Qinyun Tan)

